1
00:00:13,541 --> 00:00:14,541
Lin Zai.

2
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:16,333
How long are you going to keep this up?

3
00:00:17,083 --> 00:00:17,791
Lin Xian is dead.

4
00:00:17,792 --> 00:00:18,916
He died a long time ago.

5
00:00:18,958 --> 00:00:20,082
The moment he turned into a zombie,

6
00:00:20,083 --> 00:00:21,708
he stopped being your brother.

7
00:00:25,416 --> 00:00:26,916
Shut the hell up, A-Leh!

8
00:00:27,458 --> 00:00:29,416
Pull yourself together, Lin Zai!

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:30,750
Let go of me!

10
00:00:30,751 --> 00:00:31,999
Stay out of my business!

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,707
No matter how much you
cry over that pile of dirt,

12
00:00:33,708 --> 00:00:34,708
it won't bring him back.

13
00:00:34,875 --> 00:00:35,750
Aside from torturing yourself,

14
00:00:35,751 --> 00:00:36,791
it's completely pointless.

15
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,541
What the fuck do you know?!

16
00:00:58,208 --> 00:00:59,375
Is that all you've got?

17
00:00:59,625 --> 00:01:00,625
Come on, hit me again!

18
00:01:55,583 --> 00:01:56,583
It's okay. It's alright.

19
00:02:00,333 --> 00:02:01,333
It's all over now.

20
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:08,800
"The Last Oath"

21
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:13,600
(Episode 23: Communication After The Fall)

22
00:03:22,750 --> 00:03:24,166
Eat something.

23
00:03:24,416 --> 00:03:25,416
Just one bite.

24
00:04:15,958 --> 00:04:16,958
A-Leh.

25
00:04:17,708 --> 00:04:19,416
I want to go outside and get some sun.

26
00:04:21,375 --> 00:04:22,375
Okay.

27
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,000
Brother,

28
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:36,083
growing up,

29
00:04:36,916 --> 00:04:39,083
it feels like I competed
with you in everything.

30
00:04:40,458 --> 00:04:41,458
Grades,

31
00:04:41,833 --> 00:04:43,125
competitions,

32
00:04:43,541 --> 00:04:44,541
experiments.

33
00:04:47,125 --> 00:04:48,375
Yet after all these years,

34
00:04:49,916 --> 00:04:51,333
I don't think I ever

35
00:04:52,583 --> 00:04:54,333
truly beat you once.

36
00:04:56,375 --> 00:04:58,000
You were always one step ahead of me.

37
00:04:59,916 --> 00:05:01,166
Even when you lost your way,

38
00:05:02,041 --> 00:05:03,583
you went further than I ever could.

39
00:05:06,375 --> 00:05:07,666
So this time,

40
00:05:08,916 --> 00:05:10,596
I want to be the one walking ahead of you.

41
00:05:23,579 --> 00:05:25,719
[Potassium Cyanide]

42
00:06:42,878 --> 00:06:43,878
Wait.

43
00:06:43,902 --> 00:06:45,194
I've gotten stronger.

44
00:06:51,625 --> 00:06:52,958
Am I still changing?

45
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:17,125
Nice weather today.

46
00:07:18,875 --> 00:07:19,875
It's alright.

47
00:07:26,708 --> 00:07:27,874
Tell everyone to hide.

48
00:07:27,875 --> 00:07:28,750
I'll go check it out.

49
00:07:28,791 --> 00:07:29,791
Be careful.

50
00:07:30,458 --> 00:07:31,583
Get inside, quick!

51
00:07:32,208 --> 00:07:33,208
Go back!

52
00:07:33,333 --> 00:07:34,333
Get inside!

53
00:07:45,250 --> 00:07:46,583
Drop your weapons.

54
00:07:50,541 --> 00:07:51,375
Hey there, friends.

55
00:07:51,458 --> 00:07:52,498
Where are you coming from?

56
00:07:53,541 --> 00:07:54,541
What brings you here?

57
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:06,791
Now, there's no need for that.

58
00:08:07,541 --> 00:08:08,916
Let's just talk this out.

59
00:08:09,541 --> 00:08:10,750
Why resort to violence?

60
00:08:11,083 --> 00:08:11,916
Cut the crap.

61
00:08:11,916 --> 00:08:12,916
Open the door.

62
00:08:26,750 --> 00:08:27,750
A-Leh!

63
00:08:38,583 --> 00:08:39,583
Leh Ri?

64
00:08:42,375 --> 00:08:43,375
You're still alive?

65
00:08:46,625 --> 00:08:47,625
What are you doing here?

66
00:08:48,416 --> 00:08:49,583
HQ just got a tip.

67
00:08:49,875 --> 00:08:50,583
There's an immune subject here.

68
00:08:50,584 --> 00:08:52,083
I already found the immune subject.

69
00:08:52,583 --> 00:08:54,083
I have him under control.

70
00:08:55,083 --> 00:08:56,708
Right now, he's locked up in—.

71
00:09:53,250 --> 00:09:54,666
They're from Herin.

72
00:09:56,208 --> 00:09:57,528
They came looking for the immune.

73
00:09:59,958 --> 00:10:00,958
So,

74
00:10:01,208 --> 00:10:02,500
you're with Herin too?

75
00:10:03,958 --> 00:10:05,583
But you just killed them all.

76
00:10:08,291 --> 00:10:09,291
Lin Zai.

77
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,000
From now on,

78
00:10:11,791 --> 00:10:12,871
there are no more missions.

79
00:10:13,166 --> 00:10:14,166
No organization.

80
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,000
There's only you.

81
00:10:20,899 --> 00:10:21,899
Really?

82
00:10:55,791 --> 00:10:56,916
Wherever you want to go,

83
00:10:57,125 --> 00:10:58,125
however you want to live,

84
00:10:58,541 --> 00:10:59,541
I'm with you.

85
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:06,750
But...

86
00:11:08,208 --> 00:11:10,500
I can't even find a reason to live anymore.

87
00:11:14,083 --> 00:11:15,583
I couldn't find one either, once.

88
00:11:18,583 --> 00:11:19,666
Growing up,

89
00:11:20,086 --> 00:11:21,958
I only lived so I wouldn't be eliminated.

90
00:11:24,583 --> 00:11:25,916
My parents sold me off

91
00:11:26,916 --> 00:11:28,596
because I was just an extra mouth to feed.

92
00:11:29,583 --> 00:11:30,916
The organization trained me

93
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,583
to use me as a weapon.

94
00:11:34,458 --> 00:11:35,708
My existence

95
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:38,875
didn't mean a thing to anyone.

96
00:11:44,083 --> 00:11:45,208
Until I met you.

97
00:11:48,208 --> 00:11:49,750
You taught me what it's like to hurt,

98
00:11:50,375 --> 00:11:51,495
what it's like to be afraid,

99
00:11:52,666 --> 00:11:53,708
and how to

100
00:11:59,791 --> 00:12:00,791
love.

101
00:12:03,958 --> 00:12:05,358
If you can't find a reason to live,

102
00:12:06,750 --> 00:12:08,083
then let's

103
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:10,750
be each other's reason.

104
00:12:12,166 --> 00:12:13,166
Okay?

105
00:12:25,541 --> 00:12:26,750
Can I do that?

106
00:12:47,875 --> 00:12:49,083
Leave me behind!

107
00:12:49,916 --> 00:12:50,916
Go!

108
00:12:56,125 --> 00:12:57,125
My name is Lin Zai.

109
00:12:57,208 --> 00:12:57,875
"Lin" as in forest,

110
00:12:58,041 --> 00:12:59,041
"Zai" as in the present.

111
00:12:59,791 --> 00:13:00,500
A-Leh.

112
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:01,500
"Leh" as in raging fire.

113
00:13:10,083 --> 00:13:11,083
This is for you.

114
00:13:12,291 --> 00:13:13,291
A-Leh,

115
00:13:13,583 --> 00:13:14,958
do you want to stay?

116
00:13:15,333 --> 00:13:16,333
I came looking for you

117
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,416
because you're immune.

118
00:13:18,958 --> 00:13:20,125
You bastard!

119
00:13:21,750 --> 00:13:22,999
And to think I treated you as a friend!

120
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,833
I trusted you so much!

121
00:13:25,666 --> 00:13:26,749
Let go, you jerk!

122
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:27,830
I need to use the bathroom.

123
00:13:27,916 --> 00:13:28,916
I'll help you.

124
00:13:43,708 --> 00:13:45,041
You're not tying him up?

125
00:13:46,750 --> 00:13:47,750
He's sleeping with me.

126
00:13:50,916 --> 00:13:52,582
Is there anything else
in your heart right now

127
00:13:52,583 --> 00:13:53,583
besides your damn mission?

128
00:13:53,583 --> 00:13:54,583
Yes, there is.

129
00:14:03,750 --> 00:14:04,750
A-Leh,

130
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,250
I'm begging you.

131
00:14:07,083 --> 00:14:08,583
Please just let me go, okay?

132
00:14:17,958 --> 00:14:18,958
It's yours now.

133
00:14:20,416 --> 00:14:21,416
Protect yourself.

134
00:14:41,958 --> 00:14:43,083
I will protect you

135
00:14:45,583 --> 00:14:46,583
with my life.

136
00:14:55,958 --> 00:14:57,083
In such a hurry to leave?

137
00:14:57,250 --> 00:14:58,541
Then go by yourself.

138
00:14:59,125 --> 00:15:00,291
I love you.

139
00:15:01,458 --> 00:15:02,708
But I don't love you.

140
00:15:03,125 --> 00:15:04,250
I don't believe it.

141
00:15:04,666 --> 00:15:05,666
I don't—.

142
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:08,916
Why do you...

143
00:15:10,583 --> 00:15:12,263
Why do you smell like He Yao's cigarettes?

144
00:15:20,333 --> 00:15:21,333
Lin Zai,

145
00:15:40,958 --> 00:15:42,358
no matter what happens from now on,

146
00:15:43,083 --> 00:15:44,500
you have to tell me.

147
00:15:47,750 --> 00:15:49,458
Don't carry it all by yourself anymore.

148
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:52,500
Okay.

149
00:16:05,125 --> 00:16:06,291
You can.

150
00:16:08,875 --> 00:16:10,166
We both can.

151
00:16:28,791 --> 00:16:29,791
A-Leh,

152
00:16:30,416 --> 00:16:32,000
does this mean you defected?

153
00:16:33,083 --> 00:16:34,500
Will they hunt you down?

154
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:37,750
Don't worry.

155
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,000
I know how to handle it.

156
00:16:45,333 --> 00:16:47,093
Your life before joining
the organization...

157
00:16:47,333 --> 00:16:48,573
how much of it do you remember?

158
00:16:51,541 --> 00:16:52,541
Why do you ask?

159
00:16:53,916 --> 00:16:55,416
I just want to know more about you.

160
00:16:58,916 --> 00:17:00,250
I was very young back then.

161
00:17:01,791 --> 00:17:02,791
My parents' faces

162
00:17:02,792 --> 00:17:04,083
are all a blur now.

163
00:17:05,083 --> 00:17:07,166
My last memory of them

164
00:17:07,791 --> 00:17:09,500
is being dragged away while

165
00:17:11,916 --> 00:17:13,196
they stood there counting money.

166
00:17:14,166 --> 00:17:15,166
After that,

167
00:17:16,083 --> 00:17:18,123
I spent my whole life
training in the organization.

168
00:17:20,666 --> 00:17:21,541
A-Leh

169
00:17:21,542 --> 00:17:22,750
isn't your real name, right?

170
00:17:23,208 --> 00:17:24,500
What's your real name?

171
00:17:26,083 --> 00:17:27,083
My real name?

172
00:17:28,083 --> 00:17:29,083
I...

173
00:17:29,333 --> 00:17:30,333
forgot.

174
00:17:30,958 --> 00:17:31,958
What?

175
00:17:32,541 --> 00:17:33,708
You definitely remember.

176
00:17:34,416 --> 00:17:35,125
I really don't.

177
00:17:35,125 --> 00:17:36,125
My name is just A-Leh.

178
00:17:37,083 --> 00:17:38,458
You won't even tell me this?

179
00:17:38,750 --> 00:17:39,416
You have to tell me!

180
00:17:39,666 --> 00:17:40,125
Come on!

181
00:17:40,375 --> 00:17:41,083
Spill it!

182
00:17:41,083 --> 00:17:42,083
Tell me!

183
00:17:42,166 --> 00:17:43,291
Tell me, please, please!

184
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:44,166
Hurry!

185
00:17:44,250 --> 00:17:44,583
Come on!

186
00:17:44,916 --> 00:17:45,375
Just say it!

187
00:17:45,416 --> 00:17:46,708
Okay, okay, I'll tell you!

188
00:17:49,916 --> 00:17:51,083
My real name is...

189
00:17:53,333 --> 00:17:54,975
Gao Liang. [TN: It's like if he
was named Johnny Appleseed]

190
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,000
What?

191
00:17:56,875 --> 00:17:57,875
That's so corny!

192
00:17:58,916 --> 00:18:00,124
That's why I said I didn't remember,

193
00:18:00,125 --> 00:18:01,205
yet you insisted on asking.

194
00:18:03,875 --> 00:18:04,875
Gao Liang.

195
00:18:06,958 --> 00:18:08,291
Gao Liang, Gao Liang!

196
00:18:08,666 --> 00:18:10,066
Are you calling a damn dog or what?

197
00:18:10,916 --> 00:18:11,916
Honestly though,

198
00:18:12,076 --> 00:18:13,756
it kind of grows on me the more I say it.

199
00:18:14,208 --> 00:18:14,708
Gao Liang!

200
00:18:15,083 --> 00:18:16,333
Gao Liang, Gao Liang!

201
00:18:16,625 --> 00:18:17,625
Gao Liang!

202
00:18:25,958 --> 00:18:27,918
Looks to me like you're
just asking to be kissed.

203
00:18:29,250 --> 00:18:30,333
And what if I am?

204
00:18:50,166 --> 00:18:51,166
What?

205
00:18:53,125 --> 00:18:54,125
Lin Zai,

206
00:18:54,416 --> 00:18:56,750
there's something I still need to tell you.

207
00:19:03,083 --> 00:19:04,083
Where is he?

208
00:19:08,375 --> 00:19:09,375
So,

209
00:19:09,875 --> 00:19:11,166
he lied to me about everything?

210
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,000
Yes.

211
00:19:14,125 --> 00:19:15,916
I've already locked him up.

212
00:19:16,083 --> 00:19:17,250
What to do with him

213
00:19:17,666 --> 00:19:18,666
is up to you.

214
00:19:21,125 --> 00:19:22,625
Bad news! He Yao is gone!

215
00:19:23,750 --> 00:19:24,750
What?

216
00:19:25,458 --> 00:19:26,416
I'll go check it out.

217
00:19:26,416 --> 00:19:27,166
Wait for me here.

218
00:19:27,166 --> 00:19:28,166
Okay.

219
00:19:42,625 --> 00:19:43,625
Changhuan,

220
00:19:56,708 --> 00:19:58,583
I'm gonna find a place
to... use the bathroom.

221
00:19:59,666 --> 00:20:00,666
Hey, who's there?!

222
00:20:19,291 --> 00:20:20,291
Brother,

223
00:20:20,916 --> 00:20:22,291
don't look for me anymore.

224
00:20:31,416 --> 00:20:33,291
By the time you read this,

225
00:20:34,083 --> 00:20:35,333
I'll probably

226
00:20:35,833 --> 00:20:37,291
be gone already.

227
00:20:38,666 --> 00:20:39,916
Let me

228
00:20:40,666 --> 00:20:42,083
end all of this.

229
00:20:43,791 --> 00:20:44,916
This can't be real.

230
00:20:45,916 --> 00:20:47,083
This can't be happening!

231
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,000
Changhuan!

232
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,083
Changhuan!
